    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0ee0d587427a11b15109d4a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "言外之意，是让我闭口不谈。原本我也没打算说出去……。\n可是，她为什么要做到这种地步，也要贯彻自我包装呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a33bafb3157bedb199427981ba85fd81757074d1e3aeca3ce16a335a96f4a2d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
