      "uid": "zhcn:9d9417156beb70c1dd4ab81a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正式比赛一发定胜负。\n这也是自我包装的一环吗――",
      "source_fingerprint": "75bddec329c667f18375592032f7880c7000e21b5c7d4a2f5b1195206943665d",
